Unofficial-fork and trademark notice

This repository is a Persian, right-to-left (RTL) adaptation of the PatternFly
design system, licensed under the Apache License 2.0. It is built on
patternfly-design but is not a literal, one-to-one translation: directional
guidance has been mirrored for RTL layout, terminology has been revised against
a documented rule, and original sections — most notably a Persian RTL-vs-LTR
design teaching layer — have been added that do not exist upstream.

This is an unofficial, independent, community adaptation. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or supported by Red Hat, Inc., the PatternFly project, or
its contributors. "PatternFly" is a trademark of Red Hat, Inc. The Apache 2.0
license grants no rights to that mark; it is referenced here solely to
describe this project's relationship to the upstream design system.

Per Apache 2.0 §4(b), every file that differs from the upstream source is
considered a modified file — in practice, nearly every content file in this
repository.
